      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is a 21-year-old caucasian girl. Their name is Daniela.\n<Picture 1> is the first frame of [Shot 1], showing <Subject 1> hunched over, talking to a little girl, <Subject 2>\n<Video 1> is <Subject 1>\n<Subject 2> is the little girl wrapped in a towel. Their name is Kelly.\n\nsummary:\n[keyframe completion + reference generation] <Subject 2> Kelly hands an ice cream to <Subject 1> Daniela, who takes it and enjoys it while the camera starts a slow truck in.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1] first frame): fully_preserved - it is used as the opening frame of [Shot 1] exactly as given.\n<Subject 1>: fully_preserved - \n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a live-action, candid video, made outdoors on a professional camera.\n[Shot 1] The camera starts on the same wide framing as <Picture 1>, holding static while a hunched over <Subject 1> takes an ice cream handed to her by <Subject 2>. She thanks the girl - (S1) says: <d>[English] Thank you!</d>, then stands up straight and starts eating the ice cream. As she starts eating, the camera begins a slow, steady truck in toward her, and the truck in is still in motion when the shot ends.\n[Shot 2] No cut: the very same shot continues, and the camera keeps trucking in until it stops on a close up of <Subject 1> Daniela enjoying the ice cream.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nOutdoor ambience fitting the scene.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
        "{\"version\":1,\"mode\":\"REF\",\"off\":{},\"duration\":5,\"p2Shot\":1,\"lastShot\":1,\"imd\":\"\",\"soundscape\":\"\",\"music\":\"N/A\",\"ref\":{\"subjectDefs\":[{\"text\":\"<Subject 1> is a 21-year-old caucasian girl.\",\"name\":\"Daniela\",\"role\":null},{\"text\":\"<Picture 1> is the first frame of [Shot 1], showing <Subject 1> hunched over, talking to a little girl, <Subject 2>\",\"role\":null},{\"text\":\"<Video 1> is <Subject 1>\",\"role\":null},{\"text\":\"<Subject 2> is the little girl wrapped in a towel.\",\"role\":null,\"name\":\"Kelly\"}],\"summaryTypes\":[\"reference generation\",\"keyframe completion\"],\"summaryText\":\"!Kelly hands an ice cream to !Daniela, who takes it and enjoys it.\",\"retention\":[{\"label\":\"<Picture 1>\",\"context\":\"[Shot 1] first frame\",\"marker\":\"fully_preserved\",\"note\":\"it is used as the opening frame of [Shot 1] exactly as given.\"},{\"label\":\"<Subject 1>\",\"context\":\"\",\"marker\":\"fully_preserved\",\"note\":\"\"}],\"styleLine\":\"The target video is a live-action, candid video, made outdoors on a professional camera.\",\"detail\":\"[Shot 1] The camera holds a static shot, showing a hunched over <Subject 1> taking an ice cream handed to her by <Subject 2>. She thanks the girl - (S1) says: <d>[English] Thank you!</d>, then stands up straight with the ice cream in hand, moving it closer to her mouth. \\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.000, the shot cuts to a medium-close up, as !Daniela is enjoying the ice cream. The camera arcs around the subject with small amplitude at slow speed.\",\"soundscape\":\"Outdoor ambience fitting the scene.\",\"music\":\"N/A\"}}"
